      "created_at": "2013-01-26T19:54:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Go with Mayday sleeves, size 63.5 X 88.&nbsp; They will fit in the box.&nbsp; Your penny sleeved cards should fit fine vertically in the box.&nbsp; It won't close entirely, but it'll store all of them fine for the time being.</p>",
