      "created_at": "2013-01-28T03:08:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm also using penny sleeves.&nbsp; I'm using them primarily for errata inserts and upgrading my Ver. 1 copy of the basic set to the EE wordings.&nbsp; I really like the \"H\" mechanic.</p>",
